WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.280
Bangkok. A tropical megacity where heat costs lives and livelihoods.

2
00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:10.200
Nearly eight in ten informal workers surveyed cut their hours in the heat.

3
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:16.120
In 2026, Bangkok opened three hundred and four cooling centres.

4
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:20.620
They work best close to home.
